sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Go/Gin API
    participant Auth as Auth middleware
    participant Service as Registration service
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Student->>FE: Select classes and submit registration
    FE->>API: POST /api/registrations\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
    API->>Auth: Validate JWT and session
    Auth->>Repo: Load auth_sessions and user
    Repo->>DB: SELECT active session and current role
    DB-->>Repo: Session state
    Repo-->>Auth: Authenticated principal
    Auth-->>API: Continue request
    API->>Service: RegisterBatch(user, class_ids)

    loop Each class in request order
        Service->>Repo: Check class, capacity, schedule, prerequisites
        Repo->>DB: SELECT and lock registration data
        DB-->>Repo: Current class and student state
        Repo-->>Service: Validation data
        alt Registration allowed
            Service->>Repo: Insert registration
            Repo->>DB: BEGIN, write registration and enrolled count, COMMIT
            DB-->>Repo: Transaction committed
            Repo-->>Service: Registered result
        else Registration rejected
            Service-->>Service: Map business error
        end
    end

    Service-->>API: Per-class results and counts
    API-->>FE: 200 JSON response
    FE-->>Student: Show registered and failed classes
